--------------------
<code>assert this.peek().equals(item);</code>
--------------------
<code>assert this.get(0).equals(item);</code>

However, based on the natural language assertion "After the operation, the added element is stored at the first position," we need to consider the top of the stack, which is the last element in the vector. Therefore, the correct assert statement should be:

<code>assert this.get(this.size() - 1).equals(item);</code>
